{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50326","headline":"哭押牙四寂 · 佚名","name":"哭押牙四寂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哀哉存殁苦难量，共恨沦流处异乡。\n可叹生涯光景促，旋嗟死路夜何长！空令肝胆摧林竹，每使心魂痛渭阳。\n缧绁时深肠自断，更闻凶变泪沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}